comment.body:
This can be done in a single iteration instead of going twice over all the events:

```rs
fn key_package_pair_counts(events: &[Event]) -> (usize, usize) {
    let mut canonical = 0;
    let mut legacy = 0;

    for event in events {
        match event.kind {
            MLS_KEY_PACKAGE_KIND => canonical += 1,
            MLS_KEY_PACKAGE_KIND_LEGACY => legacy += 1,
            _ => {}
        }
    }

    (canonical, legacy)
}
